1
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
-Kite is still alive.
-[gasps]

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:13,000
He would never be beaten,
not by something like that.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,000
So now, we get strong and we find him.

4
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

5
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,000
[singer singing in English]

6
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:04,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

7
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:06,000
[singer singing in English]

8
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:26,000
[singer singing in English]

9
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:28,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

10
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:49,000
PROMISE X AND X REUNION

11
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:04,000
they must fulfill the one condition
set by Chairman Netero,

12
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:06,000
the leader of the Extermination Team.

13
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:10,000
What are those, Killua?

14
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:12,000
They're shogi tiles.

15
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:14,000
You take a piece of marked wood
and split it,

16
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:17,000
then you give each half
to a different person.

17
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:21,000
You can use it as proof of identity,
or to verify a document.

18
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:27,000
[Netero] We have already placed
two assassins in the nearest city.

19
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:34,000
each of the two assassins
have the other halves.

20
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:49,000
[indistinct conversations]

21
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:55,000
It's been erased.
That means someone checked the board.

22
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:57,000
[Gon grunts]

23
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:06,000
You must be Killua and Gon.

24
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:09,000
It's nice to meet you.

25
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:13,000
My name is Palm.

26
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:31,000
Let's sit down and have some tea.

27
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:38,000
I am Knov's pupil, you see.

28
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:45,000
He told me I would only get in his way,
but I insisted on accompanying him.

29
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:47,000
Who's that?

30
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:50,000
Don't know.
One of the guys with Chairman Netero?

31
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:52,000
[Palm] Yes, the one in a black suit.

32
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:56,000
My teacher is a wonderful man.

33
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:59,000
Cool and intelligent and composed.

34
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:13,000
[laughs]

35
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:17,000
I mean, respect is considerable factor

36
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:20,000
when it comes to falling in love,
after all.

37
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:24,000
[gasps] And my teacher knows nothing
about this, of course.

38
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:27,000
I have never said a word to him,
and I never will.

39
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:28,000
[slurping]

40
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,000
[both groaning]

41
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:34,000
[sighs]

42
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:38,000
Though in matters of the heart,
you can never really say for certain.

43
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:44,000
Love is a spontaneous thing
that goes without saying, don't you agree?

44
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:46,000
Uh, can I interrupt?

45
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:48,000
-Aren't we supposed to fight you?
-Huh?

46
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:52,000
Oh, dear, yes, I apologize.

47
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:55,000
The Chairman and my teacher said
I couldn't accompany them,

48
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:58,000
which is quite unfortunate, if you ask me.

49
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:25,000
Oh, of course, by "spending time with him"
I don't mean that he and I--

50
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:27,000
Argh! What is the condition?

51
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:33,000
You have to take down Knuckle and Shoot.

52
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:35,000
It's unthinkable, really.

53
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:42,000
How dare those vulgar, rude,
barbaric brats go to the NGL before me?

54
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:54,000
[Gon] So she's an enhancer like me.
I don't like this.

55
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:58,000
Hold on. Knuckle and Shoot?
So you're not here to fight us?

56
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:00,000
-That's right.
-[boys gasp]

57
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:06,000
After all, I am not the one who's been
assigned to defeating Knuckle and Shoot.

58
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:08,000
That job belongs to you.

59
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:18,000
They too received a condition.

60
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:30,000
We only have one month's time.

61
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:36,000
Okay, we were told to keep these tiles
in our possession for a month.

62
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:41,000
So you can bet that in that time
someone's gonna come for them.

63
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:04,000
And I'm a Beast Hunter!

64
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:08,000
Extermination Team candidates,
I challenge you to a duel.

65
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:24,000
So come and fight me, okay?

66
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:25,000
[man 1] Where?

67
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:27,000
[man 2] What location?

68
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:30,000
[man 3] You have to tell them
where to find you.

69
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:32,000
Bring it on. Hear me?

70
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:40,000
You won't get away from me.

71
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:42,000
[Killua] I wouldn't go
even if he said where.

72
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:47,000
[Killua] He's just a decoy.
His partner's probably hiding somewhere.

73
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:50,000
You know, I'm even willing to bet
that they're watching to see

74
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:53,000
if anyone reacts suspiciously
before they make a move.

75
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:56,000
And according to Palm,
they don't even know our names.

76
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:59,000
-So we're in the clear.
-Mmm-hmm.

77
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:02,000
They were just trying
to lure us out somehow.

78
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:04,000
Only an idiot
would pull a stunt like that.

79
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:14,000
[Gon] What's it gonna take to defeat him?

80
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:26,000
Also, according to that guy,

81
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:29,000
I'm not qualified to judge
if a fight can be won.

82
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:31,000
But I disagree.

83
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:36,000
If you want to survive,
you have to increase your odds of victory.

84
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:46,000
If you're fighting someone you can only
beat once or twice out of a hundred times,

85
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:48,000
-don't bother.
-[gasps]

86
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:52,000
You want 50-50 at least.

87
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:57,000
70% or better if it's at all possible.

88
00:08:57,000 --> 00:09:00,000
And for us to get to that point,
there are still two things we have to do.

89
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:04,000
We need to work on
all our fundamental skills

90
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:06,000
-and learn about our opponent's abilities.
-[grunts]

91
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:14,000
[Gon] Hmm.

92
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:17,000
Half of me agrees with you
and half doesn't.

93
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:19,000
What does that mean?

94
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:22,000
I agree that we should work on
our fundamentals.

95
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:25,000
I just don't agree we need to know
exactly what their abilities are.

96
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:28,000
Really? Why the hell not?

97
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:32,000
Come on, why add to all the risks
without any real benefits?

98
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:36,000
I know, but once we're inside,
that is what we're going to be facing.

99
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:38,000
[gasps]

100
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:42,000
Our goal isn't to defeat
Knuckle and Shoot, it's to get stronger.

101
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:45,000
Strong enough to go back to the NGL
and rescue Kite.

102
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:54,000
I mean, we've got to be powerful enough to
beat enemies we don't know anything about

103
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:55,000
at a moment's notice.

104
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:32,000
[both gasp] You two know each other?

105
00:10:32,000 --> 00:10:35,000
[Palm] No, I just did
a little research on you.

106
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:38,000
Okay, but we only know her from…

107
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:52,000
We must plot to kill
Mr. Morel's disciples.

108
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:53,000
[boys] No, thanks.

109
00:10:58,000 --> 00:11:00,000
-[Biscuit] Now let's get started.
-[boys] Osu!

110
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:02,000
[grunts]

111
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:04,000
That hurt! What was that for?

112
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:24,000
[Gon] But you don't understand.

113
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:28,000
We have to get back there
as soon as possible so we can save Kite.

114
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:30,000
Wait, what are you talking about?

115
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:40,000
[Neferpitou] That was so much fun.

116
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:51,000
I'd love to do it again.

117
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:54,000
With you.

118
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:58,000
[Biscuit] I see.

119
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:06,000
What if you make
those same mistakes again?

120
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:10,000
[Killua] At her age, no wonder
she's a pro at chewing people out.

121
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:22,000
Show me Ren.

122
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:32,000
Killua, how long can you go?

123
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:36,000
On a really good day,
I can do just about 55 minutes max.

124
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:39,000
Do that,
and then we can move on to the next step.

125
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:42,000
Train like your lives depend on it.

126
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:44,000
[laughs]

127
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:55,000
[grunts]

128
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:58,000
[groans, pants]

129
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:02,000
[Biscuit] Oh, come on,
you didn't even last an hour.

130
00:13:02,000 --> 00:13:04,000
Okay, now keep going.

131
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:07,000
[both straining]

132
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:15,000
They say it should take about a month
to prolong your Ren by a mere 10 minutes.

133
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:24,000
[dog whimpers]

134
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:29,000
Damn them!
Those damn bastards didn't even show up!

135
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:32,000
You cowards deserve to die!

136
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:34,000
[barks]

137
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:44,000
So where the hell's your owner?

138
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:48,000
You gotta pick up after your dogs.
Keep our parks clean, damn it.

139
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:04,000
And from the looks of it, now would
be the perfect time to use my ability.

140
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:05,000
Hmm.

141
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:27,000
[piano playing]

142
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:34,000
[Biscuit] Magical Spa Services.
Peachy relief. Piano massage.

143
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:37,000
[Gon sighs]

144
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:39,000
[sighs]

145
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:41,000
-[Palm] Excuse me.
-Huh?

146
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:47,000
I do hope I'm not rude for saying this,
but I'll let you choose how to train them.

147
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:50,000
My ability selected you
is the answer I seek, after all.

148
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:54,000
However, if after a month

149
00:14:54,000 --> 00:14:58,000
we determine it would be impossible
for them to defeat Morel's pupils,

150
00:14:58,000 --> 00:15:03,000
I sincerely doubt that
I would be able to restrain myself.

151
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:06,000
I must go to the NGL.

152
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:09,000
I want to go right now, in fact.

153
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:19,000
and then I don't get to go,
then I may end up killing you all.

154
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:28,000
Therefore, if you don't think
they stand a chance,

155
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:31,000
you should give up sooner
rather than later.

156
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:37,000
My anger won't be as terrible then,
judging by my past experiences.

157
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:40,000
I'm really not the one
you should be telling that to.

158
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:42,000
You can tell the two of them
when they're awake, okay?

159
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:00,000
[grunts]

160
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:02,000
[Palm gasps]

161
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:05,000
That's how he is. Just have faith in him.

162
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:06,000
[grunting]

163
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:16,000
-[shuddering] Oh, dear! Oh, gosh! Oh, no!
-[Biscuit] Hmm.

164
00:16:16,000 --> 00:16:21,000
Anyway, at the moment, I'm far more
concerned about the guys back in the NGL.

165
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:25,000
What exactly does the Chairman
plan to do for the next month? Hey.

166
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:31,000
Uh… Oh, they said
they were going to scout and whittle,

167
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:40,000
The experts can't come to a consensus
on how much time remains

168
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:43,000
between now and when the king is born.

169
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:45,000
The Chairman is acting on the assumption

170
00:16:45,000 --> 00:16:48,000
that the earliest it will be
is in two months.

171
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:52,000
This isn't good.

172
00:16:56,000 --> 00:16:59,000
That thing looks a lot stronger than me.

173
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:03,000
[Knov] Stronger than you, Chairman?
Surely you jest.

174
00:17:17,000 --> 00:17:21,000
And although I'm flattered, I'm currently
just about even with the two of you.

175
00:17:22,000 --> 00:17:24,000
Then you're more than
strong enough, Chairman.

176
00:17:25,000 --> 00:17:27,000
You should be more confident.

177
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:35,000
[scoffs] Always ready with a comeback.

178
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:37,000
But we've still gotta fight them.

179
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:41,000
I would prefer to avoid that eventuality.

180
00:17:42,000 --> 00:17:45,000
A non-violent solution
would be a much better outcome.

181
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:49,000
Our target is the Queen,
and the Queen alone.

182
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:55,000
But it will be quite difficult
to slip through his En surveillance.

183
00:17:55,000 --> 00:17:57,000
There is no way to avoid confrontation.

184
00:17:58,000 --> 00:18:02,000
The only question is
how we'll manage to win.

185
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:05,000
If you have any ideas,
I'd be glad to hear them.

186
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:08,000
[scoffs] You love to tease, don't you?

187
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:12,000
You already knew what you would do
when you chose the two of us, didn't you?

188
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:19,000
We go and exterminate the Ants silently
one at a time.

189
00:18:44,000 --> 00:18:47,000
Now let's take it slow, all right?

190
00:18:56,000 --> 00:18:57,000
Now, go.

191
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:33,000
I guess you have a point there.
It's possible that they're decoys.

192
00:19:33,000 --> 00:19:34,000
Hey, wait a sec.

193
00:19:34,000 --> 00:19:36,000
Was I just speaking out loud?

194
00:20:03,000 --> 00:20:06,000
[Neferpitou] Meow I get it.
So you're Shaiapouf.

195
00:20:07,000 --> 00:20:10,000
Well, a mere observation.

196
00:20:10,000 --> 00:20:13,000
So you can read my thoughts, can't you?

197
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:14,000
I'm not sure I like it.

198
00:20:15,000 --> 00:20:18,000
I can understand the sentiment.
[chuckles softly]

199
00:20:20,000 --> 00:20:25,000
But soon, [giggles] he'll awaken.
That's wonderful news.

200
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:30,000
'Cause, you see,
I still haven't made a final decision

201
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:32,000
about exactly
what ability I should develop.

202
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:43,000
Oh, yeah, it's so simple.

203
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:46,000
All I need to do is fix him.

204
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:03,000
[laughing]

205
00:21:28,000 --> 00:21:29,000
No way.

206
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:31,000
We'll never give up.

207
00:22:09,000 --> 00:22:11,000
[closing theme music playing]

208
00:23:29,000 --> 00:23:30,000
[upbeat music playing]

209
00:23:33,000 --> 00:23:35,000
[Gon] Next time, Duel and Escape.

210
00:23:36,000 --> 00:23:37,000
It's on, Killua.

211
00:23:37,000 --> 00:23:38,000
[Killua] It's on, Gon!

212
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:41,000
[both yell] Janken rock!

213
00:23:42,000 --> 00:23:43,000
[Gon] I lost.

214
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:47,000
[singer singing in Japanese]
